# Product

New UI lives in `frontend/`. Do not edit `frontend-legacy/` except to read old behavior.

We are on **UI only**. AI tools are empty shells with the right steps. Full source: `docs/PRODUCT.md`.

Three role choices: **Couple**, **Planner**, and **Vendor**. Role choice opens the public role landing. Auth begins from that page's account buttons.

Couple path: choose wedding → plan myself or hire planner → start love story.
Planner path: find leads → pitch look → find vendors.
Vendor path: show services → show work → meet couples.

After OTP auth, new users complete a role-specific public profile. Couple details and requests are shared only with approved planner/vendor accounts.

Signup is one question per screen. Match `docs/PRODUCT.md` before inventing extra pages.
